	(text "SWD SERVICE — physical Tag-Connect, autonomous supply qualification"
		(at 25.4 25.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e52f895e-0230-48b3-84fc-67b016adc5af")
	)
	(text "3.3V probe; NO TARGET POWER. Initial100kHz.\nLoaded VOH >=2.4V / VOL <=0.4V; signal <=3.6V.\nVTref <=1mA; digital leakage <=10uA; cable/pads <=50pF.\nAssert NRST >=10ms AFTER supply qualification; verify actual probe."
		(at 218.44 43.18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5a8ac323-1302-42ce-991f-beb15f1f2d2a")
	)
	(text "CUSTOM — REVIEW REQUIRED: U1200A–E\nConstruction authorized; SEL HIGH closes S <-> D, LOW opens."
		(at 162.56 52.07 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(color 0 255 0 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0a2f9f33-d03d-4f36-8270-5a1b780506e7")
	)
	(text "J100: TC2030-CTX-NL external cable; PCB contacts/holes only.\n1 VTref /2 SWDIO /3 NRST /4 SWCLK /5 GND /6 unused SWO.\nNo fitted header. Native assembly-BOM exclusion API unsupported."
		(at 254 157.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1e5a0acb-ea35-42b5-890c-7ee89c741e0b")
	)
	(text "OPEN: rapid collapse/brownout, all-path injection/leakage,\nESD/ground offset, probe/cable timing/turnaround and PVT.\nIoff +/-2uA is specified at VDD=0, not a floating brownout rail.\nTPS assertion20us /hysteresis29mV are TYP only."
		(at 218.44 200.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.9 0.9)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e53552e0-59d6-499d-aab4-841251c0f3f6")
	)
	(text "DEVELOPMENT ONLY. Stock lands differ from TI examples: reserve TMUX7.70x5.90mm /TPS3.86x4.04mm full flash +clearance.\nTag: NO PASTE; central no-routing area; >=0.508mm other-signal clearance; verify cable/underside access. 16mm stack gap is not cable fit proof.\nS11 OPEN: saved fields verified; exact field anchors/font/visibility API unsupported. Adjacent parameter callouts are the available presentation path."
		(at 25.4 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9bd53a07-a969-4f5d-8a01-b1dd72afcae3")
	)
	(text "U1201: separate supply-good; no MCU/firmware/NRST enable dependency.\nK33 falling2.857–2.974V; release120–350ms; low-VDD load /collapse limits OPEN."
		(at 25.4 219.71 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "279681ab-df35-47f7-8a6e-f16d7931aa31")
	)
	(text "Target pulls stay on MCU side of330ohm paths.\nC112100n reset bypass remains on controller page."
		(at 25.4 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "558bc348-2150-42a0-87af-10a4aa57b2b8")
	)
